Template: @PKG@/cargo_users
Type: multiselect
Choices: ${USERS}
Description: 需要启用 NexusCompile 编译加速的用户:
 选中的用户会被加入 nexusnet 组，并写入该用户的 ~/.cargo/config.toml。
 初始选中项来自上一次 NexusCompile 配置；首次安装时来自当前 nexusnet 组成员。
 留空表示不修改任何用户的编译设置。
 Users to enable for NexusCompile acceleration.
 Selected users are added to the nexusnet group and receive a Cargo config.
 The initial selection comes from the previous NexusCompile setup, or from
 the current nexusnet group members on first install.
  Leave empty to skip user setup.

Template: @PKG@/rust_toolchain
Type: string
Default: stable
Description: 要由 nexusnet 下载的 Rust 编译链:
 输入 stable，或精确版本（例如 1.99.0）。
 stable 会额外安装前两个 minor 版本；精确版本只安装该版本。
 工具链会下载到 /var/lib/@PKG@/toolchains，并以 @USER@ 用户身份安装。
 Rust toolchain to download for the sidecar:
 Enter stable or an exact version such as 1.99.0.
 stable also installs the previous two minor releases; an exact version
 installs only that version.
 Toolchains are downloaded to /var/lib/@PKG@/toolchains as @USER@.

Template: @PKG@/config_error
Type: note
Description: NexusCompile 配置检查失败 / NexusCompile config check failed
 ${ERROR}
 服务已停止并禁用。请修复 /etc/@PKG@/config.toml 后运行：
 systemctl enable --now @PKG@
 The service has been stopped and disabled.
